# Standard Email Template (Active Alert)

**Subject**

```
[{{alert.actionGroupName}}] {{rule.name}} | {{context.group}}
```

**Email Body**

```text
APPLICATION MONITORING ALERT

====================================================

Alert Name      : {{rule.name}}
Severity        : {{alert.actionGroupName}}
Status          : {{context.alertState}}
Host/Resource   : {{context.group}}
Time Detected   : {{context.date}}

Reason
----------------------------------------------------
{{context.reason}}

Metric
----------------------------------------------------
Current Value   : {{context.value}}
Threshold       : {{context.conditions}}

Recommended Actions
----------------------------------------------------
1. Verify the affected application or server.
2. Review Kibana dashboards and logs.
3. Check for recent deployments or configuration changes.
4. Perform corrective actions if required.
5. Escalate according to the support process.

Kibana Rule
----------------------------------------------------
{{rule.url}}

This is an automated notification generated by Kibana Alerting.
```

