# Recovery Email Template

**Subject**

```
[RECOVERED] {{rule.name}} | {{context.group}}
```

**Email Body**

```text
APPLICATION MONITORING RECOVERY

====================================================

Alert Name      : {{rule.name}}
Status          : Recovered
Host/Resource   : {{context.group}}
Recovered Time  : {{context.date}}

Details
----------------------------------------------------
{{context.reason}}

The monitored condition has returned to normal and no further action is currently required.

Kibana Rule
----------------------------------------------------
{{rule.url}}

This is an automated recovery notification generated by Kibana Alerting.
```

These templates are designed to work with Kibana's built-in action variables and provide a consistent format for CPU, Memory, Filesystem, SQL Server, Database Error, Certificate, and Synthetics alerts.
